                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "As a fan of seedy, trashy-ass otome games with rapey, abusive characters (sue me) this still really isn't what I'm looking for when it comes to adult content VNs on Steam. Spoilers ahead. \n\nThe characters are pretty bland and their motivations for pursuing the MC are a bit nonsensical--she's a nephilim, and they want to take her power, but this is dropped pretty early on in favor of them just wanting to bang her. All of them are one dimensional and poorly realized, especially when their only schtick is abusing her until she has to reach some final penultimate decision of who she loves, for... some reason. Even the porny bits are disappointing; the game teases the entire time, MC never comes around and starts to enjoy whats happening to her, and you only get a scene that is so tame it is practically fade to black in the good endings. Bad endings, you just straight up get raped until murdered. And not in an interesting, \"oh shit, that's so sick!\" kind of way, because there's no opportunity to fall in love with the milquetoast MC.\n\nEven if you are just looking for porn, give this one a hard pass. You'd be better off even with something super vanilla, like Cute Demon Crashers.",
